@startuml
title Flujo Correos Workflow - Promesas y CNA

actor Asesor
actor Supervisor
actor Administrador
participant "Promesa/CNA\nCreationService" as Creation
participant "Promesa/CNA\nWorkflowService" as Workflow
participant "WorkflowMailer" as Mailer
boundary "Autorizacion" as Auth
boundary "Cliente\nclientes.show" as Cliente

== Asesor crea solicitud ==
Asesor -> Creation: crear Promesa/CNA
Creation -> Creation: estado = pendiente
Creation -> Mailer: correo a supervisor
Mailer -> Supervisor: Abrir autorizacion
Supervisor -> Auth: preaprobar
Auth -> Workflow: preapprove()
Workflow -> Mailer: correo a administradores
Mailer -> Administrador: Abrir autorizacion
Administrador -> Auth: aprobar/rechazar
Auth -> Workflow: approve()/reject()
Workflow -> Mailer: correo informativo
Mailer -> Asesor: Ver estado
Asesor -> Cliente: revisar ficha

== Supervisor crea solicitud ==
Supervisor -> Creation: crear Promesa/CNA
Creation -> Creation: estado = preaprobada
Creation -> Mailer: correo a administradores
Mailer -> Administrador: Abrir autorizacion
Administrador -> Auth: aprobar/rechazar
Auth -> Workflow: approve()/reject()
Workflow -> Mailer: correo informativo
Mailer -> Supervisor: Ver estado
Supervisor -> Cliente: revisar ficha

== Administrador crea solicitud ==
Administrador -> Creation: crear Promesa/CNA
Creation -> Creation: estado = aprobada
Creation -> Mailer: correo informativo
Mailer -> Administrador: Ver estado
Administrador -> Cliente: revisar ficha

note right of Mailer
Abrir autorizacion:
/autorizacion?tipo=&id=&q=&status=

Ver estado:
/clientes/{dni}
end note

@enduml
